# UnsuppressEmbeds: answers of `/phoecord unsuppress`.
unsuppress_embeds-shown = Embeds are shown again.
unsuppress_embeds-hidden = Embeds are hidden.
unsuppress_embeds-not-found = Message not found in that channel.
unsuppress_embeds-bad-message = Not a message id or link.
unsuppress_embeds-bad-channel = Not a channel id. Give digits only, a link, or run the command in the channel.
unsuppress_embeds-failed = Discord refused: { $error }
